      "type": "textEditor",
      "data": {
        "value": "<p>SPECIMEN INFORMATION</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100.033%; height: 105.152px;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 24.9316%;\"><col style=\"width: 24.9316%;\"><col style=\"width: 24.9316%;\"><col style=\"width: 24.9316%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 52.5758px;\">\n<td>Specimen site</td>\n<td>Specimen Type</td>\n<td>&nbsp;Block No.</td>\n<td>Tumor Percentage</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 52.5758px;\">\n<td>Omentectomy</td>\n<td>&nbsp;FFPE tissue block</td>\n<td>&nbsp;S-2005-A/24</td>\n<td>&nbsp;25%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>CLINICAL INDICATIONS</p>\n<p>Metastatic deposits from poorly differentiated adenocarcinoma</p>\n<p>RESULTS AND INTERPRETATION</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100.033%;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 99.8039%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Tumor Mutation Burden is 7 Mut/Mb. (TMB-Low)<br>The TMB status is considered low if the TMB score is lower than 10; intermediate if the TMB score is between&nbsp;10 and 15; and high if the TMB score is greater than 15.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
